      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223390/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir ground beef in the hot skillet until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8HxZtLjrm4y3UeJRD6OKpzyObcg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223390-spicy-slow-cooked-chili-VAT-step-02-e901147aeacb4d0587fed12d264495ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223390/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground beef, kidney beans, diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, onions, bell pepper, garlic, chili powder, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper in a slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hEV9on1fiRgGiva1B75R64DnFKk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223390-spicy-slow-cooked-chili-VAT-step-03-d23173b8f28944d491c3276cc37bed1b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223390/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low for 10 hours or High for 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
