        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/64fmV8u8DVAVw6F4C-rnCAiaoeE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/223390-spicy-slow-cooked-chili-VAT-step-04-5fdc539a1d854803b77d330741f76444.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223390/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish each serving with a spoonful of sour cream and shredded cheese.",
      "section": null,
